  )
  (lib_symbols
  )
  (text "ESP DAC - Hierarchical Schematic Overview\n\nSheet 1 (this sheet): Root / Block Overview\nSheet 2 (power.kicad_sch): Input Protection, Buck Converter, LDOs\nSheet 3 (mcu.kicad_sch): ESP32-S3, microSD/SDIO, USB-C, UART Header\nSheet 4 (amplifier.kicad_sch): TAS5825M, LC Output Filters, Speaker Connectors\nSheet 5 (clock_ui.kicad_sch): 24.576 MHz Oscillator, Low-noise LDO, Display, 3x Encoders\n\nPower Rails:\n  PVDD   - TAS5825M class-D power stage (~24 V)\n  +3V3   - ESP32-S3 and all logic (3.3 V)\n  VDD_CLK - Low-noise rail for audio clock oscillator\n  GND    - Continuous plane on L2 (no splits - inviolable)\n\nKey Signal Buses:\n  I2S_MCLK, I2S_BCLK, I2S_LRCLK, I2S_DATA - ESP32-S3 to TAS5825M\n  I2C_SDA, I2C_SCL - ESP32-S3 to TAS5825M (and display if I2C)\n  SDIO_CLK, SDIO_CMD, SDIO_D0..D3 - ESP32-S3 to microSD\n  USB_DP, USB_DM - USB-C to ESP32-S3 native USB"
